# Code Style

- **Prettier:** single quotes, trailing comma `es5`, print width 100
- **ESLint:** flat config with `typescript-eslint` and `eslint-config-prettier`; backend and frontend both use `@typescript-eslint/naming-convention` so `interface` / `type` names are PascalCase and must not use an `I` + uppercase prefix (e.g. `Logger`, not `ILogger`)
- No `console.log` in request-handling code (use Pino in backend, `logger` in frontend)
- `console.error` acceptable in pre-boot startup code
